        "content": "To visit every location starting from **21 HUB** with minimal backtracking, I recommend a counter-clockwise \"sweep\" of the map. \n\nHere is a logical route through all 34 locations:\n\n### Phase 1: The Northwest Loop\n1.  **21 HUB** (Start)\n2.  **15 Stack**\n3.  **11 Mongrel**\n4.  **9 Settled Nomad**\n5.  **4 Burns Tower**\n6.  **5 Flotsam**\n7.  **6 World's End**\n8.  **2 Fishing Village**\n\n### Phase 2: The Northern Desert\n9.  **7 Stoat**\n10. **1 Bark** (Far Northeast corner)\n11. **3 ShoBattai**\n12. **8 Heft**\n13. **13 Heng**\n14. **12 Tengu**\n\n### Phase 3: The Central Belt & Far East\n15. **10 Blister Hill**\n16. **14 Bad Teeth**\n17. **16 Black Desert**\n18. **17 Waystation 1**\n19. **18 Eyesocket**\n20. **19 Black Scratch**\n21. **20 Crab Village** (Far East tip)\n\n### Phase 4: The Southeast & South\n22. **24 TwrOfAbuse**\n23. **22 Dust King**\n24. **23 W-station 2**\n25. **31 Flat Lagoon**\n26. **32 Mourn**\n27. **33 Slave Markets**\n28. **34 W-station 4** (Bottom center)\n\n### Phase 5: The Southwest & Return\n29. **30 Shark**\n30. **29 MudTown**\n31. **28 Last Stand**\n32. **27 W-station 3**\n33. **26 Squin**\n34. **25 Admag**\n35. **21 HUB** (Finish)\n\n**Summary of the route strategy:**\nYou are essentially making a large \"S\" shape across the top of the map, traveling to the furthest eastern point, then sweeping across the bottom and finishing by coming back up the western coast to return to the Hub.",
